  "allele.forestry.bee_species.binniebees.arid": "干旱",
  "allele.forestry.bee_species.binniebees.arid.desc": "它们喜欢干燥的地方，它们的蜜脾中蜂蜡成分高，蜂蜜产量较少。|《养蜂员手册》",
  "allele.forestry.bee_species.binniebees.barren": "荒芜",
  "allele.forestry.bee_species.binniebees.barren.desc": "它们偏好沙漠，能一生都生活在没有花的地方。|《养蜂员手册》",
  "allele.forestry.bee_species.binniebees.desolate": "荒凉",
  "allele.forestry.bee_species.binniebees.desolate.desc": "不毛的荒原对其他生命来说是不折不扣的地狱，但这种蜜蜂却能在那里生生不息。|《养蜂员手册》",
  "allele.forestry.bee_species.binniebees.decomposing": "堆肥",
  "allele.forestry.bee_species.binniebees.gnawing": "噬木",
  "allele.forestry.bee_species.binniebees.rotten": "腐烂",
  "allele.forestry.bee_species.binniebees.rotten.desc": "这些蜜蜂对死去动物的腐肉有着不寻常的兴趣，还会在蜜脾里储存腐肉。它们的气味也会吸引些难闻的生物。|《养蜂员手册》",
  "allele.forestry.bee_species.binniebees.bone": "骷髅",
  "allele.forestry.bee_species.binniebees.bone.desc": "由于在野外它们基本无法保卫自己的蜂巢，所以它们选择吸引其他生物当作保镖。|《养蜂员手册》",
  "allele.forestry.bee_species.binniebees.creeper": "苦力怕",
  "allele.forestry.bee_species.binniebees.creeper.desc": "保管你能从它们身上找到爆炸般的乐趣。|Binnie，养蜂员",
  "allele.forestry.bee_species.binniebees.rock": "石头",
  "allele.forestry.bee_species.binniebees.rock.desc": "要是能给它们来张滚蜂乐队，也许就能换回些好音乐。|《神秘养蜂员》",
  "allele.forestry.bee_species.binniebees.stone": "忍耐",
  "allele.forestry.bee_species.binniebees.stone.desc": "它们蜂巢中有部分是用石头做的，蜂蜡的成分比之前更少。|《养蜂员手册》",
  "allele.forestry.bee_species.binniebees.granite": "坚毅",
  "allele.forestry.bee_species.binniebees.granite.desc": "它们能在岩石中打洞，并且和隐藏在岩石中的矿物有着超常的亲和性。|《养蜂员手册》",
  "allele.forestry.bee_species.binniebees.mineral": "坚忍",
  "allele.forestry.bee_species.binniebees.mineral.desc": "将石头蜂及其后代培育数代后，所得的蜜蜂便开始以矿物为食。|《养蜂员手册》",
  "allele.forestry.bee_species.binniebees.copper": "铜绿",
  "allele.forestry.bee_species.binniebees.copper.desc": "它们会啃咬埋在墙里的铜导线而造成供电问题，也因此声名狼藉。|《养蜂员手册》",
  "allele.forestry.bee_species.binniebees.tin": "锡灰",
  "allele.forestry.bee_species.binniebees.tin.desc": "它们的身体被金属所覆盖，它们还会蜕下这些金属用以打造蜜脾。|《养蜂员手册》",
  "allele.forestry.bee_species.binniebees.iron": "铁锈",
  "allele.forestry.bee_species.binniebees.iron.desc": "哦，锈掉的蜜蜂诶。我是不是要去打针破伤风疫苗？|Jadedcat，养蜂员",
